# Project rules: Online store (Stripe)

- Use Stripe Checkout (Stripe-hosted). Never collect or store card numbers ourselves.
- Prices and products come from the server or from Stripe, never from the browser.
- Mark an order as paid only from a verified webhook event (check the signature), not from the success page redirect.
- Use test-mode keys during development. Ask before anything touches live keys.
- Handle the same webhook event arriving twice without creating two orders.
- The secret key and webhook signing secret live in environment variables only.
